      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Hey Claude, solve P=NP. Do a breakout. \n\nBreakthrough, I meant breakthrough! Shit shit shit Control-C Control-C Control-C.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mxui4spgpk2w",
